        <id>106482</id>
      </contributor>
      <comment>add category</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Piotr Marzec''' (b. [[August 12]] [[1971]] in [[Busko Zdrój]], [[Poland]]), better known as '''Liroy''', is a [[hip hop music|hip hop]] [[rapping|rapper]] living in [[Kielce]]. 

Unlike most other Polish hip hop performers, he achieved commercial success. His CD's include ''East On Da Mic'' (as '''PM Cool Lee'''), ''Albóóm'', ''Bafangoo'' (part 1 &amp; 2), ''Dzień Szakala'' (Jackals Day), ''L'' and ''Bestseller''.

== External links ==
